			"notes": "Arctree 1.0.2 was the last stable release for Minecraft 1.17.\n\nArctree 1.1-1.3 series have made lots of changes to the library:\n\n- Miscellaneous cleanup\n- Updated to **Minecraft 1.18**\n- Major breaking changes to the API\n- Rewritten Kotlin module\n- Fabric Language Kotlin is now bundled by default\n- Dependency version bumps\n- And much, much more!\n\nLots of your Arctree-related code will have to be updated to fit the newer API. [**Tutorial**](https://github.com/RedGrapefruit09/Arctree/wiki/1.18) for the new API.\n\n1.1-experimental and 1.2 are available on the Maven endpoint, but are highly unstable and not feature-complete.\\\n1.3 is the first 1.18-tested release you should use. Sorry for the long porting!"
